  <x:String x:Key="Text.RemoveWorktree.DetachedBackupHint" xml:space="preserve">This worktree is in detached HEAD state. A local backup ref (30-day retention) will be created automatically before removal.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.RemoveWorktree.DirtyAndIgnoredBlockHint" xml:space="preserve">Uncommitted changes, untracked files, or ignored files (.gitignore) were detected. Regular removal is blocked; check explicit force confirmation below to permanently delete the worktree directory.</x:String>
