  <x:String x:Key="Text.Discard.BackupRetentionNotice" xml:space="preserve">Before discarding or deleting files, GitNest saves a local backup kept for 30 days (restorable in View Logs → Discard Recovery). .git, submodules, nested repos, and ignored files remain untouched.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Discard.IgnoredSafeNote" xml:space="preserve">Ignored files (.gitignore / .git/info/exclude) are never deleted or cleaned.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Discard.UnbornHeadBlock" xml:space="preserve">This repository has an unborn HEAD (no commits yet). Cannot restore to HEAD; restore to index or clean untracked files instead.</x:String>
